      "These act as “lightning rods” to draw Plasma Grenadier fire. If required, use engineer build tool to place outside of build zone. Spotlights are very fragile and easily destroyed, avoid using them unless ore reserves do not allow for towers. Utilize free spotlights from the engineer special ability, outside of the build area instead of spending ore on them.",
      "Note: Large gates can withstand two grenadier hits when “reinforced” and when opened do not block sight lines for firing at targets from the regular base walls. These make exceptionally strong lightning rods as they do not need to be rebuild as frequently during an infinite horde scenario.",
